5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the gap between the development budget and the ongoing running costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I am curious about the actual outcomes of past initiatives. We need to know if they truly helped patients.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am worried about how new programs affect existing staff. I want to see the current roster pressures before we commit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I worry about whether the hospital can physically absorb a new program. Rooms, parking, and booking screens are already tight.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about programs that start well but quietly fall apart in the second year. I want to see where recent efforts broke down.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shion, that is a fair point. I am also looking at the ledger to see what the allocation actually covers.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Jonathan, the ledger is just numbers. I want to know if those numbers translated into better patient outcomes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, I agree. But without stable staffing, even good outcomes fade. I will check the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Midori, staffing is key, but I am checking the booking system records. If the screens are already maxed out, new programs just add chaos.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Midori, I understand your concern. I will look at the board minutes on the jointly run clinic to see how that arrangement held up.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Kenji, the booking data will show if we have physical slack. I will check the ledger and the regional fund tariffs to understand the true cost.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Kenji, physical space is secondary. I will examine the readmission figures from the call-back trial to see if that intervention actually reduced returns.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"@Jonathan, the tariffs matter, but I am also checking the therapy and midwifery staffing review. I need to see where the real pressure sits.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Shion, outcomes matter, but if the rooms are full, patients can't even get in. I will check the rooms, parking, and shuttle coverage.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, I appreciate your focus on outcomes. I will also look at the data agreements with outside surgeries to see if those partnerships are truly sustainable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will review the ledger and the regional fund tariffs. I need to know the true financial scope before we proceed.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will examine the readmission figures from the call-back trial and the visit completion on the shared nursing round.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I will review the ward nursing vacancies and agency cover, plus the therapy and midwifery staffing review. I need to see where the real pressure sits.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I will check the booking system records and the rooms, parking, and shuttle coverage. I need to see if the physical infrastructure can handle the load.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will review the board minutes on the jointly run clinic and the data agreements with outside surgeries. I need to see where those partnerships truly rested.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
